        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Under the bright moonlight, there's a unicycle. With all of the garbage cleared away, it stands there in clear view."
    },
    {
        "text": "It's leaning to one side, not propped up against anything, yet it doesn't fall over."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did I have too much to drink? How can that be? I only had half a bottle of sake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1904_1#1$3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stranger still, she sees a tiny helmet suspended in the air above the unicycle. If an invisible person were riding that unicycle, the helmet looks like it would be the perfect size for them."
    },
    {
        "text": "But since Hoshiguma sees no invisible rider, to her eyes, the little helmet is simply\u2026 floating in midair."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it a bug planted by the police, or one of Kinbee's tricks? Is it Uncle Tessai's doing? Was it created with some Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
