    {
        "text": "The unicycle speeds ahead, with Hoshiguma chasing it."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoshiguma can clearly see that the spinning pedals are propelling the unicycle forward and the tiny helmet is moving up and down in rhythm..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Why does it seem like an invisible person is riding the unicycle? When the vehicle turns, its pedals scrape the ground, causing a few sparks."
    },
