    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_oldtvelectricity",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...peace of mind and financial security, Mitsukue Life Insurance Company.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Music)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Konbanwa.</i> This is the Kinseki Channel Nightly News. The time is now 1:30 AM.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's almost the witching hour... when the ghosts are most active... ugh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "...the plan formed with the Northern Court was thwarted...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Heavy rain beats down on Isazaki; damage to the agricultural plate remains under control...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "...now let's turn to the Mitsukue entertainment industry, which is turning some heads...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
