        "posfrom": "0,-80",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What? What happened? An earthquake? A Catastrophe?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "a",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sound of signal interference)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Emergency. Emergency. This is not a drill. This is not a drill.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are under attack by the Northern Court. Repeat, we are under attack by the Northern Court.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "For your own safety, please follow these instructions:",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Unknown, ear-piercing sound)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#18$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Northern Court? How can that be?! What's really going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sound of signal interference)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Momoka! Momoka! Momoka!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on? That's... a recording of my concert?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alone in this land, we all float on by\u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our fleeting tender moments, cause such deep sighs\u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me forever gaze into your...\u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Audio glitches)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "...gaze into your\u2014gaze into your\u2014gaze into your\u2014gaze into your\u2014gaze into your\u2014gaze into your\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014If you are inside, close all doors and windows\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gaze into your\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gaze into your\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Voice on TV",
        "delay": 0.1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#18$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "AHHH! AHHHHHHHHH!!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_container_smash",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Momoka jumps up from the tatami with a start. The thing that has just appeared on the screen is simply too bizarre. She flings whatever is in her hands at the TV in a panic."
    },
    {
        "text": "She hasn't touched the remote at all, but the TV starts to flick through the channels by itself."
    },
    {
        "text": "...and now, finally, we welcome you all to the 'Midnight Heartbeat Cloudbeast Bar' on Nita Street \u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mifune~ \u266a Credit Bank~ \u266a",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mi...Mif...Credit...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chairman... give her another chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Familiar Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That voice...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "A familiar female voice emanates from the TV. The fear in Momoka's heart slowly eases, and she peeks out from behind the giant pillow in an attempt to see the screen more clearly."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
