        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are at a crucial crossroads.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Somewhat Familiar Male Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand. However... we do not have evidence of her meeting Tessai in private.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Extremely Familiar Female Voice"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio-san? And Mifune, the chairman of the group?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it playing on the TV? A recording, or a livestream?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Momoka rubs her eyes."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,-50"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,-50"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio, she's out of control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if this wasn't on Tessai's orders, if it happened once, it'll happen again. So do what you did before\u2014make her vanish quietly, without a trace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mifune-san, now is not the right time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're still pleading for mercy on her behalf.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If she were to suddenly disappear now, we'd have to pour much more effort into controlling the media narrative, which might derail your plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Must you always wear that pitiful expression?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since you have a soft spot for her, fine, just find any excuse to terminate the contract and force her into retirement... Oh, right, and find a way to get her infected with Oripathy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mifune-san, I\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have two paths to choose from. Take your pick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1896_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't forget\u2014out of a house full of trash, she just had to pick up that broken blade. We searched everywhere and couldn't find it, so we had no choice but to hastily forge a fake one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if she didn't do it intentionally, that changed everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mifune"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$transmission"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "o",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_funnel_end_h",
        "channel": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "curtain"
    },
    {
        "tag": "bgeffect"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "64_g15_higashiroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Oripathy... Mifune-san... is telling Mio-san to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who does he want to infect with Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "What was that business about a broken blade...? I picked up a broken blade in a house full of garbage?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "After falling out of the Haunted House, Momoka quickly changed outfits, wrapping her dirty clothes into a bundle, and left the filming location."
    },
    {
        "text": "The 'stick' was most likely wrapped up with the bundle of dirty clothes."
    },
    {
        "text": "When Momoka stands up and goes to the entrance, she takes the stick-like thing out of her dirty clothes."
    },
    {
        "text": "And the 'stick' is indeed a broken blade."
    },
    {
        "text": "'...changed everything'? This broken blade changed everything?"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every instinct tells her to hurl the blade out the window, as far as she can. But she knows it will only make things worse."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd better hold onto it. If there's someone out there that wants it, I can always return it, or at least...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "She can't tell if it's because she picked up that blade in the Haunted House, or because of what Mifune said on the TV\u2014but a shiver crawls up her spine and all the way to the top of her head."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.4,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.4,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "She turns the desk lamp on and off... and then on again... and off again."
    },
    {
        "text": "With the light on, she's afraid someone will see her shadow in the window."
    },
    {
        "text": "With the light off, she's afraid some intruder will burst in, under cover of darkness."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're talking about how they'll get rid of me? Just because of what I posted online? Just because I picked up a broken blade?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I gonna get disappeared? Infected with Oripathy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No way. I must have it wrong. They didn't even mention my name\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_woodenstairfts",
        "volume": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Suddenly, she hears footsteps coming from downstairs. They sound familiar, steady, and fast."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "150,0",
        "duration": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of this has pushed Momoka to her breaking point. She can guess who is coming, but with every footstep, she backs a little further away..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "150,0",
        "posto": "350,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "...All the way to the window"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_doorknob",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "posfrom": "-150,0",
        "posto": "-150,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Momoka?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I figured you were sleeping, so I just let myself in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you always knock three times first.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "The one you're going to... dispose of, it's not me, is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dispose of you? Momoka, you\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The person you were talking about murdering, or infecting with Oripathy... it's not me, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#21$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio-san, I have no idea why, but just now, my TV tuned itself to a weird channel and broadcast a conversation you had with Mifune-san... about getting rid of someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#22$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "All I know is that our agency is part of the Kinseki Group, and that the Kinseki Group and the Kinsekikai's finances are linked. I thought there wasn't any more to it than that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you weren't talking about me, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1901_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Momoka, come with me. There's still a way out of this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1918_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you <i>were</i> talking about me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "64_i16",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "64_g11_odenstall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... need to clean up here. I still have so much more cleaning to do. I'm going to close the door now. You wait outside for me, okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "text": "She may have said she was going to close the door, but Momoka is too afraid to even take a step forward."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio remains standing in the doorway."
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. You don't need to help me. I'll take care of it myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "64_i16",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.2,
        "yScale": 1.2,
        "y": -60,
        "x": -30
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to help you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mio-san, don't...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Momoka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image",
        "image": "64_i16",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "xScale": 1.5,
        "yScale": 1.5,
        "y": -150,
        "x": -50
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I'm going to help you, Momoka.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mio"
    },
    {
        "text": "She says that same line for a third time, with the same blank expression on her face. In that instant, her very presence, once warm and familiar, becomes terrifying."
    },
    {
        "text": "Momoka takes a few breaths, and to her amazement, finds herself..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "imagetween",
        "xScaleFrom": 1.5,
        "yScaleFrom": 1.5,
        "xScaleTo": 1,
        "yScaleTo": 1,
        "duration": 1,
        "yTo": 0,
        "block": false,
        "xTo": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 5,
        "randomness": 50,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...opening the window and jumping off the second floor."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "64_g11_odenstall",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
