        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me, sir, but a unicycle passed by your shop just now. Did you happen to see which way it was going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "A unicycle? I didn't see any unicycle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yatai Vendor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, Nita Street is just up ahead\u2014it's jam packed with people. There's no way anyone would be riding a bike in that direction.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yatai Vendor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not a normal unicycle, it's a small\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Small? How small?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yatai Vendor"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very small. It zooms by so fast, it's a blur. There's a little helmet floating in midair above the unicycle as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... isn't this the oden yatai I was at last night?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Tooru Moriuchi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yatai Vendor"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure you're chasing 'a unicycle with a small helmet floating midair above it'?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I sure am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's... not good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "text": "The unicycle you were chasing is known as the Wanyuudou. They say It often appears together with the Ao-Oni of the Haunted House. Some even believe they're actually one entity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know a lot about kaidan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no one on this whole street that knows kaidan better than I do. And that's not just a boast\u2014\u2014it's true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm looking for someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_136_hsguma_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, I hope you're not looking for some Ao-Oni from twenty years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha. Of course not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4199_makiri_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm looking for <i>kami-sama.</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Moriuchi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
